  "name": "Ranger Brigand keeps melee auto-attacking after buffing an ally, changing quiver and releasing in a dungeon (#13978)",
  "contract": [
    "#13978, #13816 and #14039 (Ranger, Brigand specialization 30): inside a dungeon the melee auto attack stops for",
    "good after the Ranger buffs a party member with Woodsman's Adaptation 803324 or Footpad's Adaptation 523493,",
    "after a quiver change, or after dying and releasing; ranged Auto Shot keeps working and only a relog or a mind",
    "control brings melee back. Bags cannot change in combat (equip error 60), so the quiver changes before the",
    "fight. Both buffs are instant and the release revives the player at the dungeon start",
    "(Razorfen Kraul entrance trigger 244, 1943, 1544.63, 82 on map 47). The grouped players enter Razorfen Kraul",
    "together, and each melee target is a Training Dummy 32666 inside the player's boundary radius so facing never",
    "gates a swing. Expected: the server keeps landing main-hand melee swings after each trigger."
  ],
